1
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:21,280
[Based on Er Gen's novel of the same name]

2
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:28,039
[Recap]
You lower-sect insect.

3
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:30,952
Do you have any idea
what the Sima family represents?

4
00:02:30,953 --> 00:02:32,479
Now!

5
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:34,559
Spiritual charm!

6
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,879
Rejuvenation!

7
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:38,399
I've ascended to
the Innate Lightning Spirit Body!

8
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,999
Well refined.

9
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:43,060
I'll use his blood to sharpen the blade.

10
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,479
Qing.

11
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:47,719
It looks like the Capturers' Division...

12
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:49,239
will have plenty to do soon.

13
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:54,160
[Episode 46: Visitor from Wanggu]

14
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:58,359
<i>The war
between Seven Blood Pupils and the Sea Corpse Clan</i>

15
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:00,599
[Mermaid Island]
<i>has lasted for over a year.</i>

16
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:02,079
[Sea Corpse Islands]

17
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:04,359
<i>Since the war began,</i>

18
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:07,439
<i>Seven Blood Pupils' three armies
marched out together.</i>

19
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,159
<i>Wherever they pointed their blades,</i>

20
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:11,719
<i>they were invincible.</i>

21
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:13,479
<i>The Sea Corpse Clan was routed,</i>

22
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:15,039
<i>retreating at every turn,</i>

23
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:18,479
<i>eventually falling back to their capital.</i>

24
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:20,959
<i>Seven Blood Pupils pursued relentlessly.</i>

25
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:23,879
<i>The three armies converged
at the capital's gates,</i>

26
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:26,559
<i>surrounding it completely.</i>

27
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:29,839
<i>Now, the Sea Corpse Clan is at its end.</i>

28
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,279
<i>The Sea Corpse King is making a final stand,</i>

29
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,919
<i>rallying the entire clan's strength</i>

30
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:36,820
<i>for a fight to the death
against Seven Blood Pupils.</i>

31
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,500
Halt!

32
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,919
Beat the drums!

33
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:02,799
Advance!

34
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:12,220
By the Seventh Lord's decree!

35
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:24,399
You want to breach
the Sea Corpse King's capital?

36
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:26,599
[Sea Corpse King]
It won't be that easy.

37
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:30,039
[Zhuchen Clan's Guardian Colossus]

38
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,759
Zheng Kai Yi.

39
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:33,839
Your army may be powerful,

40
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:36,639
but the Sea Corpse Clan
and our allies, the Zhuchen Clan,

41
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:40,479
have built 378 Guardian Colossi.

42
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:42,239
If you think you can break through,

43
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:44,119
you are mistaken.

44
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:47,839
Retreat now to avoid disgrace.

45
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,599
If you wait until you're defeated,

46
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:54,060
you'll suffer heavy losses
and utter humiliation.

47
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:59,439
Look closely at those 378 colossi.

48
00:04:59,440 --> 00:05:03,640
Are they yours, or mine?

49
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,900
What?

50
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:15,959
My lady, it's up to you now.

51
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:18,359
[Zhuchen Saintess]
By the Clan Leader's order,

52
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:22,719
our clan's colossi will now fight
alongside Seven Blood Pupils

53
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:25,119
to slay all of the Sea Corpse Clan

54
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:27,820
and raze the Sea Corpse King's capital!

55
00:05:28,880 --> 00:05:31,799
The... the Zhuchen Clan has rebelled!

56
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:33,519
- Shrink the defense line! Retreat!
- You...

57
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:36,439
You actually turned the Zhuchen Clan
against us!

58
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:39,319
<i>First, you used the fleet
to lure our artifacts to fire.</i>

59
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:41,639
<i>Then you sent warriors
to land during the interval,</i>

60
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:43,799
<i>forcing my colossi to appear.</i>

61
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:46,079
<i>And once the colossi appear,</i>

62
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:49,039
<i>they are no longer
under the Sea Corpse Clan's control.</i>

63
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:52,799
<i>Every step of the plan was linked.</i>

64
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:55,919
The Sea Corpse Clan's morale has collapsed.

65
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:58,140
It's time.

66
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,679
By the Seventh Lord's orders:

67
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,799
All troops, attack!

68
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:06,799
- Kill them!
- Raze the Sea Corpse King's capital!

69
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,919
Leave no survivors

70
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:11,479
among those who resist!

71
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,780
Don't retreat!

72
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,540
Wait!

73
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,480
What's going on?

74
00:06:26,481 --> 00:06:27,999
- Look!
- What is that?

75
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:30,439
They're half a minute ahead of schedule.

76
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:34,024
But... it's enough.

77
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:39,460
Such powerful pressure.

78
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,720
In the clouds!

79
00:06:41,721 --> 00:06:43,959
Seems like something is emerging.

80
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:44,960
Hear the decree!

81
00:06:44,961 --> 00:06:48,359
The Seven-Sect Alliance Decree.

82
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:51,319
Seven Blood Pupils and the Sea Corpse Clan
have been at war for a long time.

83
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:52,799
Both sides have suffered losses,

84
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,839
and corpses cover the fields.

85
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:56,639
Our Alliance considers both sects

86
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:59,359
to be pillars of Southern Phoenix Continent,

87
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:01,399
each dominating their own region.

88
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:02,999
If this fierce battle continues,

89
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,519
it will only waste your elite forces.

90
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:06,119
Victory would be hollow,

91
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:07,759
and defeat would be shameful.

92
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:10,079
What is the point of fighting?

93
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:13,159
I hereby issue this decree
to inform all factions.

94
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,799
From the day this order arrives,

95
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:16,199
cease all hostilities

96
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:18,239
and return to your respective bases.

97
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:20,599
Should anyone reignite the flames of war,

98
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:23,999
the Alliance will activate
the forbidden artifacts

99
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,199
to strike with thunderous wrath.

100
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:28,079
Let this decree be strictly obeyed.

101
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:31,100
We honor the Alliance's decree.

102
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:34,199
The Alliance's decree has been announced.

103
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:37,359
The ambition of Seven Blood Pupils ends here.

104
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:40,959
Even so, it's not enough.

105
00:07:40,960 --> 00:07:45,479
Seven Blood Pupils has become
rather arrogant lately.

106
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:47,399
Go and make arrangements.

107
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:48,999
Order our Alliance's top prodigies

108
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:51,359
to go and knock them down a peg.

109
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:55,959
Let them understand who the real master is.

110
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:56,960
As you command.

111
00:07:56,961 --> 00:07:59,180
By the Alliance's decree.

112
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:06,799
Xue Lian Zi...

113
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:07,839
[Chen Yang Zi, Seven-Sect Alliance Leader]

114
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:13,160
Don't think
your little schemes can be hidden from me.

115
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:15,479
It's the bell!

116
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:18,540
Something is appearing above the Seven Peaks!

117
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:27,399
- It's the Seventh Lord!
- The Seventh Lord is back!

118
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:29,359
They've returned in triumph!

119
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:32,359
Hear me, disciples of Seven Blood Pupils!

120
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:35,919
The war is over!

121
00:08:35,920 --> 00:08:37,399
From this day forth,

122
00:08:37,400 --> 00:08:39,479
we shall feast for three months!

123
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:41,279
Let the whole world celebrate!

124
00:08:41,280 --> 00:08:44,399
- That's wonderful!
- Seven Blood Pupils won!

125
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:45,519
This is great!

126
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:47,199
My brother can come home now!

127
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:50,159
Little brother! Little sister! I'm right here!

128
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:53,159
They're back! They're all back!

129
00:08:53,160 --> 00:08:55,679
Look! Seven Peaks City is so lively today!

130
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:57,100
It certainly is!

131
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,919
Let's go. It's my treat today!

132
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:01,119
No, no. Let me pay.

133
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:03,599
The war... is over.

134
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:05,039
The war just ended.

135
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:07,160
Sixth Elder should be...

136
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:10,900
Qing! Where are we going?

137
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:14,359
The rewards have been issued.

138
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:16,159
Great! This is...

139
00:09:16,160 --> 00:09:17,199
So much!

140
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,439
I'm going to be rich this time!

141
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:20,159
The war rewards are out.

142
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:21,879
<i>It seems that in this war,</i>

143
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,599
<i>Seven Blood Pupils achieved its goal.</i>

144
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:26,660
Whoa! So many guests have arrived!

145
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:32,159
Zhuchen Clan congratulates Seven Blood Pupils!

146
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:36,359
Haiyun Sect congratulates
Seven Blood Pupils on their victory!

147
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,839
The Spirit Vine Twin-Wing Tribe

148
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:39,780
is here to offer congratulations!

149
00:09:57,160 --> 00:10:01,399
Welcome, Fellow Taoist Dong You,
to Seven Blood Pupils.

150
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:04,620
Thank you for attending our celebration.

151
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:29,760
[Master Dong You]

152
00:10:29,761 --> 00:10:32,680
Fellow Taoist Xue Lian, you're too kind.

153
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,479
Dong You Island

154
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:41,119
congratulates Seven Blood Pupils
on their victory

155
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:43,580
in the war against the Sea Corpse Clan!

156
00:10:47,920 --> 00:10:49,879
Regarding the battle
for the Sea Corpse Clan's main island,

157
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:52,399
the Seven-Sect Alliance intervened too fast.

158
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:55,319
Next, how do you plan to deal with them?

159
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:58,559
They forcibly reduced
the Sea Corpse Clan's reparations.

160
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:00,119
Their goal is balance.

161
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,399
They're trying to keep us in check.

162
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:05,479
But our focus is the Ancestral Corpse Statues.

163
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:06,959
The people from the Fifth Peak

164
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:10,039
have already made secret preparations
within the Sea Corpse Clan.

165
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:11,959
That's good.

166
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,399
However, from now on,

167
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:15,820
things will get quite lively here.

168
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:19,900
The livelier it is here,

169
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:22,679
the better we can conceal

170
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:25,860
our sect's plans for the Sea Corpse Clan.

171
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:33,319
Come, have some tea.

172
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:35,639
I heard that my granddaughter

173
00:11:35,640 --> 00:11:38,599
made a friend recently named Xu Qing.

174
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:40,999
I've heard that Xu Qing is a fine lad.

175
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:43,300
I'll give him a gift.

176
00:11:44,880 --> 00:11:46,279
This boy is like me.

177
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:48,820
A young prodigy.

178
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,780
Grandma!

179
00:11:55,760 --> 00:11:57,839
What are you doing here?

180
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,039
Lately, you've been...

181
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:01,860
Grandma, I want to marry Xu Qing!

182
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:05,039
You...

183
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:06,079
How impudent!

184
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:08,159
What nonsense are you saying before elders?

185
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:10,039
It's not nonsense.

186
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:11,599
I feel that in this world,

187
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:13,759
only he is worthy of me.

188
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:16,719
Grandma, I'll marry no one but Xu Qing.

189
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:19,959
Fellow Taoist Xue Lian, if you have time later,

190
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:24,079
could you let me meet that boy, Xu Qing?

191
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:27,279
Of course.

192
00:12:27,280 --> 00:12:29,759
The Red Sea Tribe visits Seven Blood Pupils.

193
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:32,159
The Six-Tailed Heavenly Fox Tribe visits.

194
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:34,719
The Lingyuan Sect
congratulates Seven Blood Pupils

195
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:35,839
on a victorious return.

196
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:37,199
It's so lively.

197
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:39,119
So noisy.

198
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:41,039
Qing! Wait for me!

199
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:43,660
Captain, are you that free?

200
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:48,519
You've been following me the whole way.

201
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:51,679
I'm just worried that some ill-intentioned guy
might sneak in among the guests.

202
00:12:51,680 --> 00:12:54,939
- So, I'm protecting you personally.
- Xu Qing! Xu Qing!

203
00:12:54,940 --> 00:12:56,679
The Captain is here, too.

204
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:58,479
Look at you, all beaming.

205
00:12:58,480 --> 00:13:01,239
Did some female cultivator take a fancy to you?

206
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,719
Not to me.

207
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:05,199
But I heard from a junior on duty
at the Fourth Peak...

208
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:07,959
that Yan Yan, the granddaughter
of Master Dong You,

209
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:09,639
has proposed to our Ancestor.

210
00:13:09,640 --> 00:13:11,359
She wants to marry Xu Qing!

211
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,679
What?

212
00:13:12,680 --> 00:13:14,999
Holy crap! You've got a big mouth!

213
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,159
Xu Qing?

214
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:17,980
Yan Yan?

215
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:20,103
Come with me.

216
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,999
Qing. What kind of tricks did you use?

217
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:26,199
You're almost as good as the Third Highness.

218
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:28,220
This is ridiculous.

219
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:30,959
Wait!

220
00:13:30,960 --> 00:13:33,599
Do you know how powerful Master Dong You is?

221
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:36,079
- I don't.
- She's on the same level as our Ancestor.

222
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:38,039
The Void Return Realm.

223
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:40,679
Wait... Do you even know
what the Void Return Realm is?

224
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:42,999
Even compared to the Ancestors
of the Seven-Sect Alliance,

225
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,079
in terms of combat power,

226
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,599
that old lady is no less formidable.

227
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:47,239
If you marry into her family... no!

228
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,559
If you marry Yan Yan,

229
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:49,839
why would I even need to risk my life?

230
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:53,839
From now on, just serving you daily
would be enough.

231
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:55,679
I won't even bother fixing boats.

232
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:57,759
I'll just serve you alone.

233
00:13:57,760 --> 00:13:59,879
I'm not interested.

234
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:01,319
I'll go talk to him.

235
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,399
Junior Brother Xu.

236
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:04,660
As someone who's been through this...

237
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,479
What a huge bird!

238
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:08,559
That's a crane.

239
00:14:08,560 --> 00:14:10,580
An immortal crane.

240
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:16,039
The Taisi Immortal Sect
from the Wanggu Continent

241
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:18,700
visits Seven Blood Pupils.

242
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:21,399
That's impressive!

243
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:23,359
The Taisi Immortal Sect...

244
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:25,959
They seem very wealthy.

245
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,039
Fellow Taoists.

246
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:28,799
This way, please.

247
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:29,879
San.

248
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:31,919
I have a very important piece of intel.

249
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,199
I'll sell it to you for 300,000 spirit stones.

250
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:34,279
Don't worry.

251
00:14:34,280 --> 00:14:35,639
You won't lose out.

252
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:37,399
Get the people from
the Transportation Division here.

253
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:40,319
Have them study how the Taisi Immortal Sect's
Great Wing was refined.

254
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,639
Captain.

255
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:44,639
Why haven't I heard of the Taisi Immortal Sect?

256
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:46,079
As for that question...

257
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:48,200
It's worth...

258
00:14:54,326 --> 00:14:55,999
This Taisi Immortal Sect

259
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,759
is a power from the Wanggu Continent.

260
00:14:57,760 --> 00:14:59,999
You only need to remember that their strength

261
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:02,959
is just slightly greater than our upper sect,

262
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:04,519
the Seven-Sect Alliance on the continent.

263
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:06,319
The Seven-Sect Alliance?

264
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:08,100
The upper sect?

265
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:26,100
What's going on?

266
00:15:27,520 --> 00:15:29,920
Elder! The sect's grand array
was breached! A...

267
00:15:29,921 --> 00:15:31,519
Step back.

268
00:15:31,520 --> 00:15:33,060
Yes, sir.

269
00:16:04,400 --> 00:16:06,839
The upper sect is truly something else.

270
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:08,679
We risked our lives back then

271
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:10,599
just to earn three tolls of the bell.

272
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:12,639
Now these people from the upper sect arrive,

273
00:16:12,640 --> 00:16:14,399
ignore our grand array,

274
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:16,820
and trigger nine tolls for themselves.

275
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:19,439
If they lack prestige,
they grant it themselves.

276
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:21,740
If there's no path, they build it themselves.

277
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:26,799
There's really no arguing with that.

278
00:16:26,800 --> 00:16:30,060
Just how strong is the Seven-Sect Alliance?

279
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:33,839
Actually, the Seven-Sect Alliance

280
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:35,039
consists of more than just seven sects.

281
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:37,799
It governs 137 small and medium sects.

282
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:39,239
Seven Blood Pupils is just one of them.

283
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:40,999
And the seven leading sects

284
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:43,519
correspond exactly to our seven peaks.

285
00:16:43,520 --> 00:16:44,999
The cultivation methods of our peaks

286
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:46,479
were all passed down from those seven sects,

287
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:48,039
just at a lower level.

288
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:49,999
The reason those seven are the elite

289
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:51,879
is that they all have Void Return combatants,

290
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:54,159
and each sect possesses a forbidden treasure.

291
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:55,439
San knows about this.

292
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:58,079
Forbidden treasures?

293
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,119
Well...

294
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:00,519
As far as I know,

295
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:01,959
a forbidden treasure

296
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:04,879
is a title for artifacts of a certain level.

297
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:08,719
Each one has the power to annihilate a sect.

298
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:10,999
But since the alien taint is so severe,

299
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:13,380
no sect will use them lightly.

300
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:16,559
However, as a mere deterrent,

301
00:17:16,560 --> 00:17:19,180
they're enough to secure a place in Wanggu.

302
00:17:20,480 --> 00:17:23,060
Look. They're coming out.

303
00:17:24,080 --> 00:17:25,519
[Huang Yi Kun, Four Fire]
[Xuanyou Sect Prodigy]

304
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:28,030
Bring me your sect's best fighters.

305
00:17:28,031 --> 00:17:30,331
I want to take on ten of them.

306
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:38,919
I hope this trip will be fun.

307
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:43,400
[Sima Ling, Four Fire]
[Hunter Sect Prodigy]

308
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:49,959
[Four Fire Prodigy]
Lingxia Valley, Ling Jiao Jiao.

309
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:52,080
I've come to pay my respects.

310
00:17:55,520 --> 00:17:58,359
[Four Fire Prodigy]
Li Xun Yuan of the Divine Treasure Sect.

311
00:17:58,360 --> 00:18:00,359
Greetings, everyone.

312
00:18:00,360 --> 00:18:01,799
Since it's our first meeting,
[Yun Die, Tianming Pavilion Prodigy]

313
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:05,180
take this melody as a greeting gift.

314
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:07,440
[Zhou Qi Fan, Great Expansion Palace Prodigy]

315
00:18:07,441 --> 00:18:11,880
Junior Sister Yun, is this piece meant for me?

316
00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:24,119
Look at them, all dressed up.

317
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:25,159
What show-offs.

318
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:27,319
They're all at the Four-Fire level.

319
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:29,799
As expected of the upper sect's prodigies.

320
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:31,359
Look!

321
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:33,919
- This is...
- A vast radiance!

322
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:35,319
This... this...

323
00:18:35,320 --> 00:18:36,820
This is...

324
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:41,500
Greetings, Taoist!

325
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:45,879
Unbelievable.

326
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:48,479
Instead of greeting the Peak Lords first,

327
00:18:48,480 --> 00:18:50,519
they're welcoming the Taoist.

328
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:54,039
They clearly have no respect
for Seven Blood Pupils.

329
00:18:54,040 --> 00:18:55,780
<i>The Taoist...</i>

330
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:11,840
[Cinders Blackscale Dragon]
[Sheng Yun Zi's Great Wing]

331
00:19:30,760 --> 00:19:33,559
This pressure... is terrifying.

332
00:19:33,560 --> 00:19:35,940
<i>He's here, too.</i>

333
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:44,960
[Prismatic Whistling Lamp]
[Ancient Sovereign's Legacy Item]

334
00:19:46,120 --> 00:19:49,420
That's... a Life Lamp!

335
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:08,080
[Sheng Yun Zi, Six Fire]
[Seven-Sect Alliance's Eldest Prodigy]

336
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:16,120
[Mie Meng]
[Imperial-Grade Skill Shadow]

337
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:25,199
<i>The Golden Crow...</i>

338
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,860
<i>is reacting.</i>

339
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:37,439
What a grand entrance.

340
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:39,999
The Chief Taoist of the Seven-Sect Alliance,

341
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:42,399
First in the Lingyun Sword Sect's sequence,

342
00:20:42,400 --> 00:20:44,199
Sheng Yun Zi.

343
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:46,319
By order of the Alliance Leader,

344
00:20:46,320 --> 00:20:48,479
I bring the prodigies of the seven sects

345
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:50,239
to congratulate Seven Blood Pupils

346
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:53,140
on your victorious return.

347
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:14,359
[Major Third Wheel]

348
00:21:14,360 --> 00:21:15,999
[Master Dong You]
[The master of Dong You Island.]

349
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:17,639
[She appears to be an elderly woman
with a rather plain appearance.]

350
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:19,280
[She is Yan Yan's grandmother,
and she lost her partner many years ago.]

351
00:21:19,840 --> 00:21:36,560
[Preview]

